{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/a1cba1wb","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":19.23,"top":238.46,"width":1120.5,"height":256.8},"name":"Google Shape;49;p2","text":"The LBRCE Bus Transport Management System manages the college transport process from student registration to bus pass generation.\n\nStudents submit annual bus applications and view fees, passes, transfers and payment history. In-Charges manage their assigned buses. Administrators manage buses, routes, boarding points, academic years, fees, reports and audit records.\n\nThe system preserves historical information for every academic year and provides role-based access for students, In-Charges and transport administrators.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}}
